      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Versions & counts (as shipped):\nprompt v1  \u00b7  routing v1  \u00b7  doctrine RESTRICTION_DOCTRINE_V1\n27 rule ids (5 reject, 17 escalate, 1 auto, 4 informational)\n651 offline tests + 3 live  \u00b7  8 eval letters x 5 runs\nproviders: fake (default) | openai gpt-5-nano | anthropic",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Versions & counts (as shipped):\nprompt v1  \u00b7  routing v1  \u00b7  doctrine RESTRICTION_DOCTRINE_V1\n27 rule ids (5 reject, 17 escalate, 1 auto, 4 informational)\n651 offline tests + 3 live  \u00b7  8 eval letters x 5 runs\nproviders: fake (default) | openai gpt-5-nano | anthropic",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "23yD1kwQSReOIpDr7SouX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 795,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 120125831,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 491876989,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Legend:\norange = probabilistic (may vary run to run)\nblue   = deterministic, pure, replayable\nred    = failure paths      green = verified live",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Legend:\norange = probabilistic (may vary run to run)\nblue   = deterministic, pure, replayable\nred    = failure paths      green = verified live",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0Zze6KTnF4PjiVIVBLx-i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 470,
      "width": 779,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1059817200,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 195226477,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Business context:\nA court orders a bank to seize funds from a\ncustomer's account (a garnishment letter).\nToday a clerk reads it and makes ONE judgement:\n  auto        -> clear, act on it\n  needs_human -> uncertain, second pair of eyes\n  reject      -> not a valid order / hard fail\nWrong route = regulated incident, so every route\nmust be explainable AFTER the fact.\nWe automate the judgement and STOP there.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Business context:\nA court orders a bank to seize funds from a\ncustomer's account (a garnishment letter).\nToday a clerk reads it and makes ONE judgement:\n  auto        -> clear, act on it\n  needs_human -> uncertain, second pair of eyes\n  reject      -> not a valid order / hard fail\nWrong route = regulated incident, so every route\nmust be explainable AFTER the fact.\nWe automate the judgement and STOP there.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "W3jkRMyMDqJ8Rh4WXvska",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 880,
      "width": 925,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1550680890,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1880879863,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional requirements:\n- extract debtor_name, amount (EUR), case_reference,\n  account_iban with a REAL LLM call, behind a port\n- decide route from EXPLICIT, DETERMINISTIC rules\n  (same extraction => same route, always)\n- persist the decision + evidence (values, per-field\n  confidence, rule that fired, route)\n- POST /decisions   -> route, reasons, fields, confidence\n- GET  /decisions/{id} -> decision + full evidence",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional requirements:\n- extract debtor_name, amount (EUR), case_reference,\n  account_iban with a REAL LLM call, behind a port\n- decide route from EXPLICIT, DETERMINISTIC rules\n  (same extraction => same route, always)\n- persist the decision + evidence (values, per-field\n  confidence, rule that fired, route)\n- POST /decisions   -> route, reasons, fields, confidence\n- GET  /decisions/{id} -> decision + full evidence",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "U_WGgO1Gmxk976MFhx-Zp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 876,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 517267797,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1885511261,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-functional:\n- explainability > accuracy-today (audit first)\n- replay: re-running routing over the stored\n  record reproduces the SAME route (tested via SQLite)\n- reviewer time-to-green: make install && make test\n  < 2 min, no API key, no Docker\n- fail toward escalation, never toward auto\n- our own failure is never the letter's rejection",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-functional:\n- explainability > accuracy-today (audit first)\n- replay: re-running routing over the stored\n  record reproduces the SAME route (tested via SQLite)\n- reviewer time-to-green: make install && make test\n  < 2 min, no API key, no Docker\n- fail toward escalation, never toward auto\n- our own failure is never the letter's rejection",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KfU0_IiQ8kHM97WSTzQx5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1620,
      "width": 763,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 969559112,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 259854540,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Load (assumed, not in brief):\nmid-size bank ~ 2 000 letters/day\nRPS(write) = 2 000 / 86 400        ~ 0.02\nRPS(read)  = 2 000 * 10 / 86 400   ~ 0.25\nletter ~ 1 KB, record ~ 15 KB (raw LLM payload)\ndata/year = 2 000 * 15 KB * 365    ~ 11 GB\n=> one SQLite/Postgres node is fine.\nLatency is the LLM call (1-5 s), not the DB.\nCost: gpt-5-nano ~ $0.0003 / letter.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Load (assumed, not in brief):\nmid-size bank ~ 2 000 letters/day\nRPS(write) = 2 000 / 86 400        ~ 0.02\nRPS(read)  = 2 000 * 10 / 86 400   ~ 0.25\nletter ~ 1 KB, record ~ 15 KB (raw LLM payload)\ndata/year = 2 000 * 15 KB * 365    ~ 11 GB\n=> one SQLite/Postgres node is fine.\nLatency is the LLM call (1-5 s), not the DB.\nCost: gpt-5-nano ~ $0.0003 / letter.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pebJLaTdecvGrFIU4KpEA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2020,
      "width": 763,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 202563115,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 208157334,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Out of scope (per brief):\nexecuting/booking/reversing the seizure,\nidempotency, multi-tenancy, auth, OCR/PDF,\nqueueing, UI.\nRejected by us: LangChain/LangGraph (no graph),\npgvector/Qdrant (no retrieval), instructor\n(hides the retry that has decision semantics),\nCQRS/aggregates (one entity).",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Out of scope (per brief):\nexecuting/booking/reversing the seizure,\nidempotency, multi-tenancy, auth, OCR/PDF,\nqueueing, UI.\nRejected by us: LangChain/LangGraph (no graph),\npgvector/Qdrant (no retrieval), instructor\n(hides the retry that has decision semantics),\nCQRS/aggregates (one entity).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
