      "text": "api/ middleware + handlers:\n- Content-Length > 400 kB -> 413 BEFORE\n  the body is read; router re-checks\n  100 000 chars after decode\n- RFC 9457 problem+json for\n  422 / 413 / 404 / 503 / 500\n- 500 never echoes the exception;\n  it is logged with the traceback",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "api/ middleware + handlers:\n- Content-Length > 400 kB -> 413 BEFORE\n  the body is read; router re-checks\n  100 000 chars after decode\n- RFC 9457 problem+json for\n  422 / 413 / 404 / 503 / 500\n- 500 never echoes the exception;\n  it is logged with the traceback",
