    },
    {
      "id": "XXGAkmM3dEx7THhfkCG1f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3460,
      "y": 1350,
      "width": 1153,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "az",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1955294508,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 476822990,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Shared by both real adapters (adapters/llm/):\n- prompt.py     one system prompt, letter fenced; a letter's own\n                <letter> tags are redacted before interpolation\n- schema.py     strict Pydantic; confidences are BINS\n- mapping.py    maps only: bins -> floats, no validation\n- model_pinning aliases refused at startup (per-vendor rule)\n- attempts.py   1 identical retry on a bad answer; WARNING per\n                attempt naming the cause (schema miss / refusal /\n                incomplete / unparseable / no tool call)\n- factory.py    LLM_PROVIDER switch; SDK transport retries = 1 for both",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Shared by both real adapters (adapters/llm/):\n- prompt.py     one system prompt, letter fenced; a letter's own\n                <letter> tags are redacted before interpolation\n- schema.py     strict Pydantic; confidences are BINS\n- mapping.py    maps only: bins -> floats, no validation\n- model_pinning aliases refused at startup (per-vendor rule)\n- attempts.py   1 identical retry on a bad answer; WARNING per\n                attempt naming the cause (schema miss / refusal /\n                incomplete / unparseable / no tool call)\n- factory.py    LLM_PROVIDER switch; SDK transport retries = 1 for both",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "047AzxyfougTvjc6E1WEN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 1230,
      "width": 925,
      "height": 420,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b00",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1945314148,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 170136060,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Failure asymmetry (Principle 4):\n- model ANSWERED BADLY (schema miss, refusal, truncated,\n  unparseable; after 1 identical retry)\n    -> 201, route needs_human, rule H01, record SAVED,\n       diagnostic payload kept, WARNING per attempt\n- model NEVER ANSWERED (transport/auth/429)\n    -> 503, NO record written, ERROR logged\n       (an outage is not a clerk's work item)\n- anything unexpected -> 500 problem+json, logged,\n  detail never echoed to the client\nOur own failure never becomes the letter's rejection:\nR01-R05 and H02/H05/H06 are guarded on a successful read.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Failure asymmetry (Principle 4):\n- model ANSWERED BADLY (schema miss, refusal, truncated,\n  unparseable; after 1 identical retry)\n    -> 201, route needs_human, rule H01, record SAVED,\n       diagnostic payload kept, WARNING per attempt\n- model NEVER ANSWERED (transport/auth/429)\n    -> 503, NO record written, ERROR logged\n       (an outage is not a clerk's work item)\n- anything unexpected -> 500 problem+json, logged,\n  detail never echoed to the client\nOur own failure never becomes the letter's rejection:\nR01-R05 and H02/H05/H06 are guarded on a successful read.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bnj8MBXphpONe1FIOKTsa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
