    {
      "id": "iwvP1R_EliT8cmY4utz0E",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4720,
      "y": 130,
      "width": 893,
      "height": 595,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b03",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 78642497,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1617679930,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Extraction schema (LLM's only output surface):\ndocument_is_seizure_order + confidence BIN\ndocument_type: attachment | restriction | other\n  (a restriction of a prior order IS a seizure order;\n   the prompt says so explicitly - found live)\ndebtor_name   {value, evidence_quote, confidence,\n               is_partial_or_abbreviated}\ncase_reference{value, evidence_quote, confidence}\naccount_iban  {value, evidence_quote, confidence}\namount_candidates[]  <- EVERY figure, not one:\n  {raw_text, value_as_written (verbatim str),\n   currency, role: operative|original|restricted|\n   unknown, role_confidence, is_approximate,\n   evidence_quote, confidence}\nconfidence BIN = certain | probable | uncertain | guess\nModel does reading comprehension; WE do the\nlegal judgement (which figure applies).",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Extraction schema (LLM's only output surface):\ndocument_is_seizure_order + confidence BIN\ndocument_type: attachment | restriction | other\n  (a restriction of a prior order IS a seizure order;\n   the prompt says so explicitly - found live)\ndebtor_name   {value, evidence_quote, confidence,\n               is_partial_or_abbreviated}\ncase_reference{value, evidence_quote, confidence}\naccount_iban  {value, evidence_quote, confidence}\namount_candidates[]  <- EVERY figure, not one:\n  {raw_text, value_as_written (verbatim str),\n   currency, role: operative|original|restricted|\n   unknown, role_confidence, is_approximate,\n   evidence_quote, confidence}\nconfidence BIN = certain | probable | uncertain | guess\nModel does reading comprehension; WE do the\nlegal judgement (which figure applies).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ps3dPrZBzC9vlSxZrfBB-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4720,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 974,
      "height": 630,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b04",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 387527348,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1171397351,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Confidence per field (derived INSIDE route()):\nfinal = min(llm_self_report, grounding, validator)\nnothing can raise a score, only lower it\n\nself-report is a BIN, mapped to a float in mapping.py:\n  certain 0.97 | probable 0.88 | uncertain 0.60 | guess 0.30\n  (no float can land ON the 0.85 floor by accident)\n\ngrounding (field-typed normalisers, IBAN strips spaces):\n  quote verbatim in letter         1.00\n  case-insensitive match           0.95\n  quote absent, VALUE present      0.90  (I03)\n  neither                          0.00  (H08)\n  grounding proves PRESENCE, not authority\n\nvalidators (binary 0/1): case ref ^[A-Z]{2}-\\d{4}/\\d{2}$,\nIBAN mod-97 == 1, amount Decimal > 0 & EUR,\nname >= 2 substantive tokens",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Confidence per field (derived INSIDE route()):\nfinal = min(llm_self_report, grounding, validator)\nnothing can raise a score, only lower it\n\nself-report is a BIN, mapped to a float in mapping.py:\n  certain 0.97 | probable 0.88 | uncertain 0.60 | guess 0.30\n  (no float can land ON the 0.85 floor by accident)\n\ngrounding (field-typed normalisers, IBAN strips spaces):\n  quote verbatim in letter         1.00\n  case-insensitive match           0.95\n  quote absent, VALUE present      0.90  (I03)\n  neither                          0.00  (H08)\n  grounding proves PRESENCE, not authority\n\nvalidators (binary 0/1): case ref ^[A-Z]{2}-\\d{4}/\\d{2}$,\nIBAN mod-97 == 1, amount Decimal > 0 & EUR,\nname >= 2 substantive tokens",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sgusCTkCCU6NBOYdQzGVk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4720,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 1023,
      "height": 420,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b05",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 66873977,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 306616567,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Thresholds (hypotheses + sweep procedure, not measured):\nAUTO_MIN_FIELD_CONFIDENCE     0.85\nDOC_TYPE_REJECT_MIN_CONF      0.90  (R01: only reject\n                                    on a model opinion)\nROLE_MIN_CONFIDENCE           0.85  (also gates a LONE\n                                    candidate on a restriction)\nMIN_CANDIDATES_FOR_A_SECOND_LOOK  2  (H18)\nAUTO_MAX_AMOUNT_EUR   10 000 000  (bank policy param)\nRESTRICTION_DOCTRINE_V1: restricted figure supersedes\nthe original it cites  (evidence base n = 1, versioned)\nLive sweep (64 obs): consistent with 0.85, cannot\ndistinguish it from any value up to 0.90.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Thresholds (hypotheses + sweep procedure, not measured):\nAUTO_MIN_FIELD_CONFIDENCE     0.85\nDOC_TYPE_REJECT_MIN_CONF      0.90  (R01: only reject\n                                    on a model opinion)\nROLE_MIN_CONFIDENCE           0.85  (also gates a LONE\n                                    candidate on a restriction)\nMIN_CANDIDATES_FOR_A_SECOND_LOOK  2  (H18)\nAUTO_MAX_AMOUNT_EUR   10 000 000  (bank policy param)\nRESTRICTION_DOCTRINE_V1: restricted figure supersedes\nthe original it cites  (evidence base n = 1, versioned)\nLive sweep (64 obs): consistent with 0.85, cannot\ndistinguish it from any value up to 0.90.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2RCipPx8cjCxCeixur9bl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5900,
      "y": 130,
      "width": 958,
      "height": 595,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b06",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1111849505,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 831049062,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rule table (ordered, ALL evaluated, all recorded):\nR01..R05  reject      (not an order @>=0.90 AND type=other,\n                       case ref missing/malformed,\n                       no amount, amount <= 0)\nH01,H17,H02  reading  (malformed, doc-type CONTRADICTION\n                       (type=restriction but not-an-order),\n                       doc type uncertain)\nH05..H07  identity   (name partial, IBAN absent/invalid)\nH11,H12,H03,H18,H04,H16,H13,H14,H15  amount\n  H18 = 2+ figures and NOT a restriction order\nH08,H09   evidence quality (ungrounded, < 0.85)\nA00       auto (nothing above fired)\nI01..I04  informational, never decisive\n\ndecisive = FIRST fired route-bearing rule\nreject > needs_human > auto is structural (order)\nNaN-safe: every floor comparison uses below_floor()",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Rule table (ordered, ALL evaluated, all recorded):\nR01..R05  reject      (not an order @>=0.90 AND type=other,\n                       case ref missing/malformed,\n                       no amount, amount <= 0)\nH01,H17,H02  reading  (malformed, doc-type CONTRADICTION\n                       (type=restriction but not-an-order),\n                       doc type uncertain)\nH05..H07  identity   (name partial, IBAN absent/invalid)\nH11,H12,H03,H18,H04,H16,H13,H14,H15  amount\n  H18 = 2+ figures and NOT a restriction order\nH08,H09   evidence quality (ungrounded, < 0.85)\nA00       auto (nothing above fired)\nI01..I04  informational, never decisive\n\ndecisive = FIRST fired route-bearing rule\nreject > needs_human > auto is structural (order)\nNaN-safe: every floor comparison uses below_floor()",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6hXTnNS-mielT-Z9-QTJs",
      "type": "text",
