      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Decision record (append-only):\nid (ULID), created_at, letter_text, letter_sha256,\nmodel_id, prompt_version v1, extractor_provider,\nraw_llm_response (verbatim, or a diagnostic\npayload when nothing parsed), extraction  <- INPUT\n---- derived output of route(), stored as evidence ----\nfield_confidences {llm, grounding, validator, final},\noperative_amount, resolution reason, considered /\nsource candidate idx, doctrine_version,\nfired_rules[], decisive_rule_id, route, reasons[],\nrouting_version v1\n\nReplay: route(record.extraction) == stored output,\nasserted through a real SQLite round trip.\nA second save of the same id is ignored, never an overwrite.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Decision record (append-only):\nid (ULID), created_at, letter_text, letter_sha256,\nmodel_id, prompt_version v1, extractor_provider,\nraw_llm_response (verbatim, or a diagnostic\npayload when nothing parsed), extraction  <- INPUT\n---- derived output of route(), stored as evidence ----\nfield_confidences {llm, grounding, validator, final},\noperative_amount, resolution reason, considered /\nsource candidate idx, doctrine_version,\nfired_rules[], decisive_rule_id, route, reasons[],\nrouting_version v1\n\nReplay: route(record.extraction) == stored output,\nasserted through a real SQLite round trip.\nA second save of the same id is ignored, never an overwrite.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
