      "text": "Samples (labels from the material), verified LIVE:\n1  attachment, all fields clean     -> auto  (A00)\n2  'M. Meyer', no IBAN, 'in the\n   region of...'                    -> needs_human (H05/H02)\n3  restriction 4,250 -> 1,267       -> auto  (A00, doctrine)\n   both roles unknown / only the original /\n   restricted >= original / role conf 0.60 /\n   LONE superseded figure           -> H03/H11/H12/H03/H03\nLive: 40 runs, 0 wrong-auto; 3 live tests green.",
