    {
      "id": "mNOzBuzg_E7ayCrvLKqxp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2800,
      "y": 2400,
      "width": 893,
      "height": 385,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1434059772,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 253885930,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Tests (651 offline, no key; 3 live):\nunit: golden cases -> every RuleId fires, every\n  route-bearing rule decisive somewhere\nproperty (hypothesis x200): determinism,\n  2-valued monotonicity (lower any conf => not auto),\n  reject dominance, totality; NaN isolated on one field\nintegration: API 201/422/413/404/503/500, replay via\n  SQLite, append-only save, one log line, malformed ->\n  201 needs_human, 503 writes nothing\nevals/: run_eval --jsonl, sweep.py (live threshold\n  sweep), expectations with per-field values",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Tests (651 offline, no key; 3 live):\nunit: golden cases -> every RuleId fires, every\n  route-bearing rule decisive somewhere\nproperty (hypothesis x200): determinism,\n  2-valued monotonicity (lower any conf => not auto),\n  reject dominance, totality; NaN isolated on one field\nintegration: API 201/422/413/404/503/500, replay via\n  SQLite, append-only save, one log line, malformed ->\n  201 needs_human, 503 writes nothing\nevals/: run_eval --jsonl, sweep.py (live threshold\n  sweep), expectations with per-field values",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DkR74XSO8xo9ED-xS6WZ0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2800,
      "y": 2900,
      "width": 795,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1636081080,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 531427962,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How we'd know the rules are right:\ndeterministic half  -> golden table (CI)\nprobabilistic half  -> evals report + JSONL rows\nmeasured once       -> 64-observation live sweep:\n  0 wrong-auto at every threshold 0.50-0.99;\n  self-report is coarse (8 distinct values seen)\nreal answer         -> label ~200 letters, sweep,\n  log needs_human vs clerk verdict",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How we'd know the rules are right:\ndeterministic half  -> golden table (CI)\nprobabilistic half  -> evals report + JSONL rows\nmeasured once       -> 64-observation live sweep:\n  0 wrong-auto at every threshold 0.50-0.99;\n  self-report is coarse (8 distinct values seen)\nreal answer         -> label ~200 letters, sweep,\n  log needs_human vs clerk verdict",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RMYHHx6h15mIk2CRTF5Cd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4720,
      "y": 2300,
      "width": 1006,
      "height": 490,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 283348306,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1102191346,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If this went to production (what changes, what doesn't):\n- DATABASE_URL -> Postgres, JSON -> JSONB; repo port unchanged\n- N-sample self-consistency in the adapter: agree-or-escalate;\n  boundary unchanged  ($0.0009/letter at N=3)\n- letters arrive async? queue in front of the API; routing\n  is still a pure fn over the stored extraction\n- raise OPENAI_REASONING_EFFORT (minimal 5/6 vs low 6/6\n  stable on sample 3, N=6) - a config change, not code\n- add token/cost/request-id telemetry to ExtractionResult\n  (deferred, named, not hidden)\n- ground the ROLE label itself against the letter (today\n  H18 blocks auto on multi-figure non-restriction letters)\n- prompt/rule change => bump prompt_version / routing_version;\n  old records stay replayable under their own versions",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If this went to production (what changes, what doesn't):\n- DATABASE_URL -> Postgres, JSON -> JSONB; repo port unchanged\n- N-sample self-consistency in the adapter: agree-or-escalate;\n  boundary unchanged  ($0.0009/letter at N=3)\n- letters arrive async? queue in front of the API; routing\n  is still a pure fn over the stored extraction\n- raise OPENAI_REASONING_EFFORT (minimal 5/6 vs low 6/6\n  stable on sample 3, N=6) - a config change, not code\n- add token/cost/request-id telemetry to ExtractionResult\n  (deferred, named, not hidden)\n- ground the ROLE label itself against the letter (today\n  H18 blocks auto on multi-figure non-restriction letters)\n- prompt/rule change => bump prompt_version / routing_version;\n  old records stay replayable under their own versions",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
