      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Found by calling the model, not by arguing (verified live):\n- restriction letters were read as 'not a seizure order'\n  3/4 runs: the field was undescribed -> described; 12/12 after\n- a lone superseded figure on a restriction could go auto\n  -> role gate now applies to lone candidates too\n- float self-reports wobbled across 0.85 on the same letter\n  -> verbalised bins\n- the prompt told OpenAI to 'call a tool' it never sends\n  -> transport-specific instruction\n- '4,25.00' parsed as 425.00 -> group widths validated",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Found by calling the model, not by arguing (verified live):\n- restriction letters were read as 'not a seizure order'\n  3/4 runs: the field was undescribed -> described; 12/12 after\n- a lone superseded figure on a restriction could go auto\n  -> role gate now applies to lone candidates too\n- float self-reports wobbled across 0.85 on the same letter\n  -> verbalised bins\n- the prompt told OpenAI to 'call a tool' it never sends\n  -> transport-specific instruction\n- '4,25.00' parsed as 425.00 -> group widths validated",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
