    {
      "id": "jq7LAjvy1FPRq09PFkYkU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 3600,
      "width": 747,
      "height": 770,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1048651319,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 395239569,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "OUT: LetterExtraction  (the replay input)\n  letter_text\n  document_type: attachment_order |\n    restriction_order | other\n  is_seizure_order + _confidence\n  debtor_name   {value, evidence_quote,\n                 llm_confidence}\n  debtor_name_is_partial\n  case_reference{value, quote, llm_conf}\n  account_iban  {value, quote, llm_conf}\n  amount_candidates[] {value_as_written,\n    currency, raw_text, role, role_confidence,\n    is_approximate, quote, llm_conf}\n  model_id, prompt_version\n  extraction_status: ok |\n    malformed_after_retry\nconfidences arrive as BINS and are\n  mapped to floats in mapping.py\n+ ExtractionResult wraps it with\n  raw_llm_response (or diagnostic),\n  provider, notes\nraises ExtractorUnavailable -> 503",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "OUT: LetterExtraction  (the replay input)\n  letter_text\n  document_type: attachment_order |\n    restriction_order | other\n  is_seizure_order + _confidence\n  debtor_name   {value, evidence_quote,\n                 llm_confidence}\n  debtor_name_is_partial\n  case_reference{value, quote, llm_conf}\n  account_iban  {value, quote, llm_conf}\n  amount_candidates[] {value_as_written,\n    currency, raw_text, role, role_confidence,\n    is_approximate, quote, llm_conf}\n  model_id, prompt_version\n  extraction_status: ok |\n    malformed_after_retry\nconfidences arrive as BINS and are\n  mapped to floats in mapping.py\n+ ExtractionResult wraps it with\n  raw_llm_response (or diagnostic),\n  provider, notes\nraises ExtractorUnavailable -> 503",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
