      "text": "2a. GROUND + VALIDATE\nderive_field_confidences()",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "6IPdc28QWA1oTaGxNQNEF",
      "originalText": "2a. GROUND + VALIDATE\nderive_field_confidences()",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t0f-PczyEOSf2Pv__56o5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 3600,
      "width": 730,
      "height": 455,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1486676540,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1906008354,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IN : LetterExtraction only\nOUT: field_confidences {\n  debtor_name:    {llm, grounding, validator,\n                   final = min(...)}\n  case_reference: {...}\n  amount:         {...}  (considered cand.)\n  account_iban:   {...}  (only if present)\n}\ngrounding: is the quote / value really\n  in letter_text?  1.0 / .95 / .90 / 0.0\nvalidator: regex, mod-97, Decimal>0 2dp,\n  >= 2 name tokens         -> 1.0 / 0.0\nnothing can RAISE a score",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "IN : LetterExtraction only\nOUT: field_confidences {\n  debtor_name:    {llm, grounding, validator,\n                   final = min(...)}\n  case_reference: {...}\n  amount:         {...}  (considered cand.)\n  account_iban:   {...}  (only if present)\n}\ngrounding: is the quote / value really\n  in letter_text?  1.0 / .95 / .90 / 0.0\nvalidator: regex, mod-97, Decimal>0 2dp,\n  >= 2 name tokens         -> 1.0 / 0.0\nnothing can RAISE a score",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
