      "locked": false,
      "text": "2c. RULE TABLE\n27 rules, fixed order",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "JMY3aAXUJ-pHRkrrjkrtY",
      "originalText": "2c. RULE TABLE\n27 rules, fixed order",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sSFKpy0zhKLIRJ8DTCsS0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 3600,
      "width": 682,
      "height": 490,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1708660038,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1707347482,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IN : extraction + confidences + resolution\nOUT: RoutingOutcome {\n  route: auto | needs_human | reject\n  decisive_rule_id   (FIRST fired\n    route-bearing rule, I* excluded)\n  fired_rules[] {rule_id, route|null,\n                 reason}   ALL of them\n  reasons[]  (one sentence per fired rule)\n  + everything from 2a and 2b\n  routing_version\n}\nevery rule is evaluated, every hit is\nrecorded; order gives precedence:\nR* (reject) > H* (human) > A00 (auto)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "IN : extraction + confidences + resolution\nOUT: RoutingOutcome {\n  route: auto | needs_human | reject\n  decisive_rule_id   (FIRST fired\n    route-bearing rule, I* excluded)\n  fired_rules[] {rule_id, route|null,\n                 reason}   ALL of them\n  reasons[]  (one sentence per fired rule)\n  + everything from 2a and 2b\n  routing_version\n}\nevery rule is evaluated, every hit is\nrecorded; order gives precedence:\nR* (reject) > H* (human) > A00 (auto)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AFOpQTYe-EzG6SIYx5IOf",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 4000,
      "y": 3420,
