    {
      "id": "sZuVgWc2QkwCN4f0lz9ry",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5100,
      "width": 1932,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1826803309,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1027023337,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Precedence is the table ORDER, not a score: reject rules sit first, then the four human blocks, then A00.\nThe rule engine does NOT stop at the first hit \u2014 it evaluates all 27 and records every hit, so the clerk\nsees every defect. Only the FIRST route-bearing hit is 'decisive'. I01-I04 are informational: recorded, never decisive.\nTwo-valued guarantee (property-tested): if a letter is auto, lowering ANY single confidence makes it not-auto.\nThere is deliberately NO 'reject > human' severity scale: lowering confidence that a doc is NOT an order moves it\nfrom reject to needs_human, which is intended \u2014 escalation needs less evidence than rejection.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Precedence is the table ORDER, not a score: reject rules sit first, then the four human blocks, then A00.\nThe rule engine does NOT stop at the first hit \u2014 it evaluates all 27 and records every hit, so the clerk\nsees every defect. Only the FIRST route-bearing hit is 'decisive'. I01-I04 are informational: recorded, never decisive.\nTwo-valued guarantee (property-tested): if a letter is auto, lowering ANY single confidence makes it not-auto.\nThere is deliberately NO 'reject > human' severity scale: lowering confidence that a doc is NOT an order moves it\nfrom reject to needs_human, which is intended \u2014 escalation needs less evidence than rejection.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZPZhSd8kALZRlywbR1_i6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5370,
      "width": 1357,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 242531385,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1906093454,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Per-field contract: what must exist, what happens when it doesn't",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Per-field contract: what must exist, what happens when it doesn't",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AcquTRXKK_QvHSgQpwRy1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5450,
      "width": 1962,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1199035119,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1915688297,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1758540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "field            required  validator                          MISSING           FAILS validation       LOW conf / UNGROUNDED\n---------------  --------  ---------------------------------  ----------------  ---------------------  ----------------------\ndocument type    yes       is_seizure_order + confidence      H02 -> human      R01 (false, >=.90,     H02 (<.85 true / <.90 false);\n                                                                                type=other)            type=restriction + false -> H17\ndebtor_name      yes       >= 2 substantive tokens            H05 + H09 -> hum  H05 -> human           H09 / H08 -> human\ncase_reference   yes       ^[A-Z]{2}-\\d{4}/\\d{2}$              R02 -> REJECT     R03 -> REJECT          H09 / H08 -> human\namount           yes       resolver + Decimal > 0, 2dp, EUR   R04 -> REJECT     R05 (<= 0) -> REJECT   H16 unparseable, H13 format,\n                                                                                                        H14 not EUR, H03 ambiguous,\n                                                                                                        H04 approx, H11/H12 restriction,\n                                                                                                        H15 > ceiling, H09/H08,\n                                                                                                        H18 2+ figures & not restriction\naccount_iban     no        mod-97 == 1, ^[A-Z]{2}\\d{2}[A-Z0-9]+$  H06 -> human (never reject)  H07 -> human   H09 / H08 -> human (if present)\n\n'required' = its absence blocks auto. Only case_reference and amount absence are hard REJECTS (the brief names\nthem); a missing name or IBAN is uncertainty about our reading, not evidence the order is invalid.",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "field            required  validator                          MISSING           FAILS validation       LOW conf / UNGROUNDED\n---------------  --------  ---------------------------------  ----------------  ---------------------  ----------------------\ndocument type    yes       is_seizure_order + confidence      H02 -> human      R01 (false, >=.90,     H02 (<.85 true / <.90 false);\n                                                                                type=other)            type=restriction + false -> H17\ndebtor_name      yes       >= 2 substantive tokens            H05 + H09 -> hum  H05 -> human           H09 / H08 -> human\ncase_reference   yes       ^[A-Z]{2}-\\d{4}/\\d{2}$              R02 -> REJECT     R03 -> REJECT          H09 / H08 -> human\namount           yes       resolver + Decimal > 0, 2dp, EUR   R04 -> REJECT     R05 (<= 0) -> REJECT   H16 unparseable, H13 format,\n                                                                                                        H14 not EUR, H03 ambiguous,\n                                                                                                        H04 approx, H11/H12 restriction,\n                                                                                                        H15 > ceiling, H09/H08,\n                                                                                                        H18 2+ figures & not restriction\naccount_iban     no        mod-97 == 1, ^[A-Z]{2}\\d{2}[A-Z0-9]+$  H06 -> human (never reject)  H07 -> human   H09 / H08 -> human (if present)\n\n'required' = its absence blocks auto. Only case_reference and amount absence are hard REJECTS (the brief names\nthem); a missing name or IBAN is uncertainty about our reading, not evidence the order is invalid.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
